# `/api/health` is the only deployed function at M0. Files under `/api/_lib`
# are supporting modules, not standalone Vercel functions.
#
# When .vercelignore exists, the CLI uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore for the
# upload set — so the local .env (Neon URL, server pepper) must be excluded
# here explicitly or a `vercel` CLI deploy would upload it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Superseded assets nothing references (manifest points at -v3; the maskable
# icon shipped as PNG). og-fjale-v1/v2 stay deployed on purpose: old social
# shares may still embed those URLs.
screenshot-narrow-v2.png
screenshot-wide-v2.png
icon-maskable.svg
